# Phase 1.5 ingestion — large source files (P15-A-3 + P15-B-2, 8 June 2026)
# These exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit on push. Operator downloads
# locally; the bbox-clipped per-country CSVs that derive from them ARE
# committed (small, ~10-25 MB total).
#
# Sources:
#   gshm-2023-1.tif        — GEM 2023.1 Global Seismic Hazard Map (~173 MB)
#                            Download: https://cloud.openquake.org/s/6SnFk2f92JEr76H
#                            License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
#   era5land_*.nc          — ERA5-Land NetCDF intermediate cache (~50-200 MB each)
#                            Re-downloadable via CDS API; not deliverable artifacts
scripts/pipeline/data/cross-cutting/gshm-2023-1.tif
scripts/pipeline/data/cross-cutting/*.tif
*.nc
*.grib
